@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed shared technical components — no universal business service
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

package "Trusted application artifact" {
 component "Resource-owner handlers / domain policies" as H
 component "Small technical contracts\nClock / IDs / bounded result types" as C
 component "Infrastructure adapters\nPersistence / diagnostics / configuration" as A
 H ..> C : narrow dependency
 A ..> C : implements contract
}
component "Optional telemetry agent / sidecar\nNot selected or deployed" as S #EEEEEE
database "Restricted diagnostic destination\nFacility / retention pending" as D
A --> D : evaluated export path
A ..> S : alternative collection only
S ..> D
legend bottom
 Shared library and sidecar are different packaging/operating choices.
 No universal Shared domain model, global user singleton, service locator or privileged bypass.
 A sidecar has no automatic authority to read secrets or every private record.
endlegend
@enduml
